name: Reroll Glut — very cheap rerolls
author: corpus
description: >-
  Reroll Glut reduces reroll cost by a total of $4. Tier-2 voucher: requires Reroll Surplus
  bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: cheap rerolls,
  dig shop, find combo pieces, Flash Card scaling.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: RerollGlut
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: ChaostheClown
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: FlashCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - voucher: OverstockPlus
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
